      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dprcooke/{size}/1961_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-10-25T11:11:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Re: Tachyon’s art, I am LOVING her running shoes. I’d be willing to bet that in the universe in which Sentinels is published, there’s a crossover pair of running shoes looking like those but made by Schmike, so “you too can run like Tachyon!”. I would’ve bought them in a heartbeat.</p>",
