    {
      "id": 206918,
      "name": "Phantom5613",
      "username": "Phantom5613",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-10-25T15:18:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can really tell the difference of bodytypes the characters have with this new art. Tachyon has a slim runners build from years of speeding about versus Wraith who's a bit thicker and stockier from her physical training and martial arts practices. And as always we have the pinacle of the human physical form, Legacy. Dude is pretty buff.</p><p>I've always loved the art Adam makes for us, but I also love how you can really see his style evolve over the course of&nbsp;Multiverse, Tactics and the RPG.</p><p>Feel better soon, Mr. Rebottaro.</p>",
      "post_number": 15,
