      "cooked": "<p>I looked up the \"Warriors of the Mystic Realms\" and found the blurb from Metatopia 2014:</p><blockquote><p>[ALPHA TEST] \"Warriors of the Mystic Realms\" by Critical-Hits Studios, LLC; presented by Dave Chalker. Relive the glory of the '80s in this homage to Saturday morning cartoons, B-movie fantasy, and cheesy superhero action. In Warriors of the Mystic Realms, you play one of these Chosen, men and women gifted with fantastic and magical powers, joined together to destroy the Anti-Matter Monarch and his fiendish cross-dimensional minions. Lift your Lazer Sword! Grasp your Rocket Rifle! And summon the Valiant Hordes of Meggidon! Friday, 10:00PM - 12:00AM; Fun, 18 &amp; Over ONLY.</p></blockquote><p>Interestingly there was a <a href=\"http://www.marvunapp.com/Appendix4/pacecodyhero.htm\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">short Marvel series</a> called \"Hero: Warrior of the Mystic Realms\" in 1990.</p>",
